### Clinical images ###
# CRITICAL: this directory holds real patient photographs. It was untracked but
# NOT ignored, so a routine `git add -A` would have committed them to the
# repository and pushed them to the remote. The files currently on disk are
# deliberately left untouched.
uploads/

### Secrets and credentials ###
# Never commit these. Everything sensitive arrives as an environment variable.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
secrets.*
